    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/c085b536534c7301ff47a4ef57561284.avif?t=1754770585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Need a lift?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the Anytime Elevator and get\u00a0<strong><i>LIFTED</i></strong> \u2014 a cinematic single-player 2.5D puzzle-platform adventure from a former Disney ride designer. <strong><i>Perfect for STEAM DECK</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Slacker Ari Buktu only pokes his head into Professor Raventhorpe\u2019s lab for extra credit; seconds later he\u2019s hurtling through history on a reckless mission to steal a legendary tiara and fix the professor\u2019s love-life...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/92231c7faa33ab540f54c37d7f5eac5c.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/92231c7faa33ab540f54c37d7f5eac5c.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/92231c7faa33ab540f54c37d7f5eac5c.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platform through ancient Egypt, Mayan civilization, and more. Help Ari free climb mountainsides or use some of the professor\u2019s handy gadgets to make impossible leaps possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/0a7807a53924f2ccb647c002382fa2c7.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/0a7807a53924f2ccb647c002382fa2c7.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/0a7807a53924f2ccb647c002382fa2c7.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore caves and tombs and solve thoughtfully crafted ancient puzzles on your path to finding the tiara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/2108fff48e61c59b8c64abe944b30075.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/2108fff48e61c59b8c64abe944b30075.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/2108fff48e61c59b8c64abe944b30075.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep on your toes as danger is always afoot! Evade some of history\u2019s most notorious trouble makers in each location as they attempt to steal the tiara for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience pure movie magic in an endearing story about chasing your dreams and being who you are. Chuckle, bond, and grow alongside the characters whenever you\u2019re needing a<i> lift</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/c085b536534c7301ff47a4ef57561284.avif?t=1754770585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Need a lift?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the Anytime Elevator and get\u00a0<strong><i>LIFTED</i></strong> \u2014 a cinematic single-player 2.5D puzzle-platform adventure from a former Disney ride designer. <strong><i>Perfect for STEAM DECK</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/21bb6c0c70f6d5711a830886fd875845.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Slacker Ari Buktu only pokes his head into Professor Raventhorpe\u2019s lab for extra credit; seconds later he\u2019s hurtling through history on a reckless mission to steal a legendary tiara and fix the professor\u2019s love-life...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/92231c7faa33ab540f54c37d7f5eac5c.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/92231c7faa33ab540f54c37d7f5eac5c.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour