s as danger is always afoot! Evade some of history\u2019s most notorious trouble makers in each location as they attempt to steal the tiara for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.poster.avif?t=1754770585\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.webm?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2184020/extras/103242096c8c5266af4918a4cdf42683.mp4?t=1754770585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience pure movie magic in an endearing story about chasing your dreams and being who you are. Chuckle, bond, and grow alongside the characters whenever you\u2019re needing a<i> lift</i>.</p>",
    "short_description": "Get LIFTED! A cinematic puzzle-platformer bursting with '80s BLOCKBUSTER vibes: play as slacker Ari unwillingly starring in his prof's time-hopping tiara heist. No combat, just hilarious, FEEL-GOOD, nonstop MOVIE-MAGIC adventure.",
